      "name": "Eerie Flexibility",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>Despite its size, the gug's multiple joints allow it to fit through tight spaces as if it were a Medium creature. While Squeezing, it can move at its full Speed.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
